1
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Unexpected. Unpredictable. Uncontrollable. A deadly obsession takes hold.

2
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Enduring Love is a drama, thriller, mystery film directed by Roger Michell.

3
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:36,000
Two strangers become dangerously close after witnessing a deadly accident.

4
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:46,000
On a beautiful cloudless day a young couple
celebrate their reunion with a picnic.

5
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:56,000
Joe has planned a postcard-perfect afternoon in the
English countryside with his partner, Claire.

6
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
But as Joe and Claire prepare to open a bottle of
champagne, their idyll comes to an abrupt end.

7
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:16,000
A hot air balloon drifts into the field, obviously in trouble.

8
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
The pilot catches his leg in the anchor rope, while the only
passenger, a boy, is too scared to jump down.

9
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:36,000
Joe and three other men rush to secure the basket.

10
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:46,000
But fate has other ideas...

11
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:56,000
Joe, played by Daniel Craig.

12
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Jed, played by Rhys Ifans.

13
00:54:10,000 --> 00:54:16,000
Claire, played by Samantha Morton.

14
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:26,000
Robin, played by Bill Nighy.

15
01:02:30,000 --> 01:02:36,000
Rachel, played by Susan Lynch.

16
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Mrs. Logan, played by Helen McCrory.

17
01:10:50,000 --> 01:10:56,000
Enduring Love is a 2004 psychological thriller film directed
by Roger Michell and written by Joe Penhall.

18
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
It is based on the 1997 novel of the same name by Ian McEwan.

19
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
The film stars Daniel Craig, Rhys Ifans, Samantha Morton,
Bill Nighy, Susan Lynch and Corin Redgrave.

20
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
Enduring Love was released in the United Kingdom on 26 November 2004, by Pathé.

21
01:27:30,000 --> 01:27:36,000
Reviews were mixed.

22
01:31:40,000 --> 01:31:46,000
The film explores themes of rescue, picnic, hot air balloon.

23
01:35:50,000 --> 01:35:56,000
The tone is mind_bending and emotional and intense.
